# Build context for `az acr build` is the repo root (see scripts/_helpers.py).
# Everything here is stripped before the context is tarred and uploaded to ACR,
# which is what was making builds slow. The biggest offenders were virtual
# environments: .rvenv (~1.4 GB) at the root and a nested
# src/orchestrator_agent/.venv (~150 MB) that `COPY ./src` was also baking into
# the image. ACR's context packer needs both a directory pattern and an explicit
# descendant pattern; a trailing slash or only a `**/` prefix is insufficient.

# Python virtual environments — large, host-specific, never needed in an image.
.venv
.venv/**
.rvenv
.rvenv/**
venv
venv/**
env
env/**
ENV
ENV/**
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/.rvenv
**/.rvenv/**
**/venv
**/venv/**
**/env
**/env/**
**/ENV
**/ENV/**

# Version control & CI metadata.
.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# azd / Azure local state.
.azure/

# Python caches & build artifacts.
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info
.eggs
**/.eggs
build
**/build
dist
**/dist
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
**/.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.ipynb_checkpoints

# Node / JS deps (none are needed by the agent images).
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Local env files & secrets — agents read configuration from container env vars.
.env
*.env
!*.env.example

# Editor / OS cruft.
.vscode
.vscode/**
.idea
.idea/**
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log

# The Reachy Mini conversation front-end runs locally and is not part of any
# hosted-agent image (weather / homeassistant / orchestrator COPY ./src but do
# not import it), so keep its audio/static assets out of the build context.
src/reachy_conversation/
